{"id":5114,"date":"2024-04-11T03:45:49","date_gmt":"2024-04-11T03:45:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/2024\/04\/11\/premio-tripadvisor-travellers-choice-2023-2\/"},"modified":"2026-05-25T15:20:19","modified_gmt":"2026-05-25T08:20:19","slug":"premio-tripadvisor-travellers-choice-2023","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/premio-tripadvisor-travellers-choice-2023\/","title":{"rendered":"Pr\u00eamio Tripadvisor Travellers&#8217; Choice 2023"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>A Mundo Asia Tours tem o orgulho de receber o pr\u00eamio Tripadvisor Travellers&#8217; Choice para 2023. Gostar\u00edamos de agradecer a todos os nossos queridos clientes e parceiros pelo seu gentil apoio. Agradecemos tamb\u00e9m \u00e0 nossa esfor\u00e7ada equipe da Mundo Asia Tours pela excelente qualidade, alto desempenho e dedica\u00e7\u00e3o!<\/p>\n<h2>O que \u00e9 o pr\u00eamio Tripadvisor Travellers&#8217; Choice?<\/h2>\n<p>O Tripadvisor oferece o pr\u00eamio Travellers&#8217; Choice para ag\u00eancias de viagens, hot\u00e9is e restaurantes que sempre receberam \u00f3timas avalia\u00e7\u00f5es. S\u00e3o ag\u00eancias, empresas que est\u00e3o entre os 10% melhores estabelecimentos listados no Tripadvisor.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-55 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/mundo-team-450x281-cc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"281\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/mundo-team-450x281-cc.jpg 450w, https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/mundo-team-450x281-cc-300x187.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Especialmente a partir de 2023, a Mundo Asia oferece sa\u00eddas adicionais em portugu\u00eas para viajantes brasileiros de outubro a abril todas as semanas de <span data-sheets-root=\"1\"><a class=\"in-cell-link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/pt\/destination\/bangkok-viagens\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bangkok, na Tail\u00e2ndia<\/a><\/span>. As partidas agora s\u00e3o muito populares e estamos animados para receber mais viajantes brasileiros no Sudeste Asi\u00e1tico nas temporadas de 2023 e 2024.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Mundo \u00c1sia Tours recebe o pr\u00eamio Travellers&#8217; Choice 2023 do TripAdvisor. Agradecemos aos clientes, parceiros e equipe pelo apoio e dedica\u00e7\u00e3o!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":94622,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[12256],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5114","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5114","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5114"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5114\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":118770,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5114\/revisions\/118770"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/94622"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5114"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5114"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\